      "height": 24,
      "text": "V7 KEY CHANGES FROM V6:",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#7c3aed",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-content",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 895,
      "width": 1200,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "1. DASHBOARD NOW SCREEN 3: Moved overview/selection screen AFTER processing, BEFORE individual reviews\n   - Gives users the \"what did we find?\" moment before diving in\n   - Matches your sketch exactly: Shows 1 Story (blue with avatar), 2 Points (gray, no avatars)\n   - Each item has \"Needs review\" button to tap and start review\n   - \"Publish (0 ready)\" button disabled until items reviewed\n\n2. STORIES HAVE AVATARS: Blue circle with initial \"S\" (user's avatar)\n   - Points have NO avatar (no owner - just debatable claims)\n\n3. UPDATED FLOW: Entry → Processing → Dashboard → Story Review → Point 1 → Point 2 → Publish\n   - Dashboard is the selection/overview moment\n   - Then sequential one-at-a-time review starts\n\nShowing only first 3 screens here - rest of flow (Story Review, Point Reviews, Publish) stays same as V6",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid"
    }
  ],
  "appState": {
    "viewBackgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
    "gridSize": 20
  }
